  "steps": [
    "Mix it up and airfry at 180 degrees for 8-10 mins until crispy (You can bake it or pan fry with very little oil too)",
    "Add all of this to a container and shake it well.",
    "Add 1 tsp olive oil, 1 tbsp minced garlic and 3-4 cashews in a pan. Saute the garlic and cashews until brown.",
    "Add veggies of choice - boiled brocolli, babycorn, bell peppers, etc.",
    "Saute for 4-5 mins and add the Asian sauce along with 100ml of water and 1/2 tbsp corn flour. Mix it and add tofu.",
    "Cook on low flame until the sauce starts to thicken. Add salt and fresh basil and its ready.",
    "Serve it with sticky rice or noodles."
